<title>CHINA: Shanghai Lianhua posts H1 interim loss.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Lianhua posts H1 interim loss.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated)</p>
<p> Turnover	  85.204	vs	   107.134</p>
<p> Net profit	6.404 loss  vs	    20.019</p>
<p> Net asset per share	1.62  yuan (no comparative figure)</p>
<p> Earnings per share	 0.038 yuan loss (no comparative</p>
<p>figure)</p>
<p>Note: the figures were unaudited. Shanghai Lianhua Fibre Co Ltd is involved in production of chemical fibres and has started investment in real estate.</p>
</text>
